    {
      "source": "as of 2.0.0, in favor of \n<details class=\"invalid-tag\">\n<summary>invalid reference</summary>\n<pre><code>#defaultTools(Consumer)</code></pre>\n</details>\n.",
      "translation": "自 2.0.0 版本起，推荐使用  \n<details class=\"invalid-tag\">\n<summary>无效引用</summary>\n<pre><code>#defaultTools(Consumer)</code></pre>\n</details>\n。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "as of 2.0.0, in favor of \n<details class=\"invalid-tag\">\n<summary>invalid reference</summary>\n<pre><code>#defaultTools(Consumer)</code></pre>\n</details>\n. To be removed\nin 3.0.0.",
      "translation": "自 2.0.0 版本起，推荐使用  \n<details class=\"invalid-tag\">\n<summary>无效引用</summary>\n<pre><code>#defaultTools(Consumer)</code></pre>\n</details>  \n将在 3.0.0 版本中移除。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"DefaultChatClientBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>DefaultChatClientBuilder</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"DefaultChatClientBuilder.html\" title=\"org.springframework.ai.chat.client 中的类\"><code>DefaultChatClientBuilder</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "When <code>toolCallingAdvisorBuilder</code> is <code>null</code>, a default\n<a href=\"advisor/ToolCallingAdvisor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor\"><code>ToolCallingAdvisor</code></a> is created\nwith a <a href=\"../../model/tool/ToolCallingManager.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>ToolCallingManager</code></a> backed by the supplied\n<code>observationRegistry</code>.",
      "translation": "当 <code>toolCallingAdvisorBuilder</code> 为 <code>null</code> 时，会创建一个默认的\n<a href=\"advisor/ToolCallingAdvisor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor\"><code>ToolCallingAdvisor</code></a>，该 Advisor 由一个基于提供的\n<code>observationRegistry</code> 的\n<a href=\"../../model/tool/ToolCallingManager.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>ToolCallingManager</code></a> 支持。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "When <code>toolCallingAdvisorBuilder</code> is non-null it is used as-is. The caller is\nthen responsible for configuring the builder's <a href=\"../../model/tool/ToolCallingManager.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>ToolCallingManager</code></a>,\nincluding any <code>ObservationRegistry</code>, since the\nsupplied <code>observationRegistry</code> will not be automatically applied to it.",
      "translation": "当<code>toolCallingAdvisorBuilder</code>不为 null 时，将直接使用它。调用方随后负责配置该构建器的<a href=\"../../model/tool/ToolCallingManager.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>ToolCallingManager</code></a>，包括任何<code>ObservationRegistry</code>，因为所提供的<code>observationRegistry</code>不会自动应用其中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Default tools are shared across all requests produced by <a href=\"ChatClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClient</code></a>\ninstances built from this builder. If a request also provides its own tools via\n<a href=\"ChatClient.ChatClientRequestSpec.html#tools(java.lang.Object...)\"><code>ChatClient.ChatClientRequestSpec.tools(Object...)</code></a>, those runtime tools completely\noverride the defaults for that request.",
      "translation": "默认工具由通过此构建器创建的 <a href=\"ChatClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClient</code></a> 实例所生成的所有请求共享。如果某个请求还通过 <a href=\"ChatClient.ChatClientRequestSpec.html#tools(java.lang.Object...)\"><code>ChatClient.ChatClientRequestSpec.tools(Object...)</code></a> 提供了自己的工具，则这些运行时工具将完全覆盖该请求的默认工具。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2026 <a href=\"https://spring.io\">Broadcom Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2026 <a href=\"https://spring.io\">Broadcom Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "It provides methods to set default values for various properties of the ChatClient.",
      "translation": "它提供了设置 ChatClient 各种属性默认值的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "WARNING: Because default tools are shared, be careful not to register tools\nthat should only be available in specific contexts.",
      "translation": "警告：由于默认工具是共享的，请小心不要注册那些应仅在特定上下文中可用的工具。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"ChatClient.Builder.html#defaultTools(java.lang.Object...)\">ChatClient.Builder</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"ChatClient.Builder.html#defaultTools(java.lang.Object...)\">ChatClient.Builder</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "as of 2.0.0, in favor of <a href=\"#defaultTools(java.lang.Object...)\"><code>defaultTools(Object...)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "自 2.0.0 版本起，推荐使用<a href=\"#defaultTools(java.lang.Object...)\"><code>defaultTools(Object...)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "as of 2.0.0, in favor of <a href=\"#defaultTools(java.lang.Object...)\"><code>defaultTools(Object...)</code></a>. To be\nremoved in 3.0.0.",
      "translation": "自 2.0.0 版本起，推荐使用<a href=\"#defaultTools(java.lang.Object...)\"><code>defaultTools(Object...)</code></a>。该功能将在 3.0.0 版本中移除。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Register one or more default tools that will be available to every request\nbuilt from this <a href=\"ChatClient.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClient.Builder</code></a>.",
      "translation": "注册一个或多个默认工具，这些工具将可供从此<a href=\"ChatClient.Builder.html\" title=\"org.springframework.ai.chat.client 中的接口\"><code>ChatClient.Builder</code></a>构建的所有请求使用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"deprecated-label\">Deprecated, for removal: This API element is subject to removal in a future version.</span>",
      "translation": "<code class=\"deprecated-label\">已弃用，即将移除：此 API 元素将在未来版本中被移除。</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Any other object — treated as a <code>@Tool</code>-annotated POJO; a\n<a href=\"../../tool/ToolCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.tool\"><code>ToolCallback</code></a> is generated for each\n<a href=\"../../tool/annotation/Tool.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.ai.tool.annotation\"><code>Tool</code></a>-annotated method it\ncontains.",
      "translation": "任何其他对象——被视为带有 <code>@Tool</code> 注解的 POJO；对于其包含的每个带有 <a href=\"../../tool/annotation/Tool.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.ai.tool.annotation\"><code>Tool</code></a> 注解的方法，都会生成一个 <a href=\"../../tool/ToolCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.tool\"><code>ToolCallback</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>observationRegistry</code> - the observation registry for client-level observations;\nalso used to configure the default <code>ToolCallingManager</code> when\n<code>toolCallingAdvisorBuilder</code> is <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>observationRegistry</code> - 用于客户端级观测的观测注册表；  \n当 <code>toolCallingAdvisorBuilder</code> 为 <code>null</code> 时，也用于配置默认的 <code>ToolCallingManager</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>toolCallingAdvisorBuilder</code> - optional builder for the\n<a href=\"advisor/ToolCallingAdvisor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor\"><code>ToolCallingAdvisor</code></a>; when\n<code>null</code> a default is created",
      "translation": "<code>toolCallingAdvisorBuilder</code> - 可选的 <a href=\"advisor/ToolCallingAdvisor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor\"><code>ToolCallingAdvisor</code></a> 构建器；当为 <code>null</code> 时，将创建默认实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
